    Bug 1926711 - Account Hub Font Awareness, wrap add-on text and make email address show ellipsis at larger font sizes. r=aleca

    **How to Test**
    - Use testaccounts@o365.thunderbird.net when creating account hub account
    - Click the add-on exchange option and up the font size
    - At larger font sizes the add-on notification should wrap and the email should have an ellipsis.

